                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.5, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>建议画面：顶部模式胶囊<br />显示「本机引擎」</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 10, padding: 20, background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.04)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.10)', borderRadius: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>不用配任何东西</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.78, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不联网、不注册、不花钱，装完就是这个模式。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.45 }}>知歇 ZhiXie · V1.0.0</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.45 }}>12 / 30</Text>
